# ductura/Institution_server: owners of the paths with the critical risk floor
# (CRITICAL_PATHS in scripts/engineering/risk-floor.ts).
#
# As in Ductus .github/CODEOWNERS, these entries only RECORD ownership. GitHub
# requests a code-owner review only when the author is not the owner, and the
# "Require review from Code Owners" setting is not changed by this file.
# The machine protection is the risk floor, independent review and QA, and the
# owner's merge command (D-97).
#
# The last matching rule wins; every rule has an owner, so no later rule can
# clear an earlier one. server/risk-floor.test.ts checks that every critical
# path is covered.
